<view class="page value-page"><text class="title">{{title}}</text><view wx:if="{{view === 'stories'}}" class="intro muted">留下一季耕耘的痕迹。整理事实、证据与备注，由本人决定是否授权公开。</view><view class="note">农事卡→核验依据→采收批次→供货与反馈。本机交互原型，非真实农事、现货、交易或质量认证。</view>
<block wx:if="{{!blocked}}"><scroll-view wx:if="{{tabs.length > 1}}" scroll-x="{{true}}" class="value-tabs"><view class="value-tab-line"><button wx:for="{{tabs}}" wx:key="id" class="{{'value-' + view === item.id ? 'active' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="select">{{item.title}}</button></view></scroll-view>
<view class="surface"><text class="heading">{{context ? context.identity.org : '消费者公开最小摘要'}}</text><view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="label" class="value-proof"><text class="label">{{item.label}}</text><view class="muted small">{{item.copy}}</view></view><view class="small muted gap">公开页不读取农户GPS、卡号、家庭授权或私人成本；示例和未确认项明确标注。</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{view === 'passport' &amp;&amp; context &amp;&amp; (context.identity.role === 'farmer' || context.identity.role === 'cooperative')}}" class="surface"><text class="heading">批次摘要与独立审核</text><textarea class="textarea" data-field="note" value="{{note}}" bindinput="edit" maxlength="500" placeholder="采收批次、缺项和实物对应说明"/><checkbox-group bindchange="publicConsentChange"><label class="value-check"><checkbox value="confirmed" checked="{{publicConsent}}"/><text>已核对本次摘要公开范围（演示）</text></label></checkbox-group><button class="primary" bindtap="savePassport">保存待独立审核草稿</button><view class="pill gap">{{passportStatus}}</view><view class="small muted gap">无自审核、自动发布或假溯源二维码；混合批须另建并关联全部来源。</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{view === 'calendar'}}" class="surface"><text class="heading">关注与询价</text><button class="secondary" bindtap="follow">{{followed ? '取消本机关注' : '关注成熟窗口示例'}}</button><textarea class="textarea" data-field="description" value="{{description}}" bindinput="edit" placeholder="产品、成熟窗口及交接要求（测试）"/><button class="primary" bindtap="saveNote">保存询价意向草稿</button><view class="small muted gap">供货日历是预测，不代表锁定数量或已认购。</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{view === 'stories'}}" class="surface"><text class="heading">从有来源的摘要整理记录</text><button class="secondary" bindtap="generate">使用核验记录示例生成草稿</button><textarea class="textarea" data-field="storyText" value="{{storyText}}" bindinput="edit" maxlength="2000" placeholder="不编造照片、发言或检测结论"/><checkbox-group bindchange="consentChange"><label class="value-check"><checkbox value="confirmed" checked="{{consent}}"/><text>已核对内容与媒体授权，仍待本人确认</text></label></checkbox-group><button class="primary" bindtap="saveStory">保存待本人确认草稿</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{view === 'income'}}" class="surface"><text class="heading">方案经营账</text><view class="field" wx:for="{{fields}}" wx:key="id"><text class="label">{{item.label}}</text><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{item.value}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindinput="formEdit"/></view><button class="primary" bindtap="calculate">保存并测算净收益</button><view wx:if="{{incomeResult}}" class="value-results"><view class="kv"><text>现金净收益测算</text><text>¥{{incomeResult.cashNet}}</text></view><view class="kv"><text>含家庭劳动净收益</text><text>¥{{incomeResult.fullNet}}</text></view><view class="kv"><text>完整成本 / kg</text><text>¥{{incomeResult.unit}}</text></view><view class="kv"><text>×1.35参考价 / kg</text><text>¥{{incomeResult.reference}}</text></view></view><view class="small muted gap">仅方案测算，不是确认利润。避免“其他”与包装等重复计入；按键不算人天，购买不等于施用。卡片分摊100元可按本季实际口径调整。</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{view === 'grades'}}" class="surface"><text class="heading">按数量、等级与用途找货</text><text class="label">产品关键词</text><input class="input" data-field="gradeProduct" value="{{gradeProduct}}" bindinput="edit"/><text class="label">需求等级</text><picker range="{{gradeOptions}}" value="{{gradeIndex}}" bindchange="gradeChange"><view class="input">{{gradeOptions[gradeIndex]}}</view></picker><text class="label">需求数量</text><input class="input" type="digit" data-field="quantity" value="{{quantity}}" bindinput="edit"/><text class="label">数量单位</text><picker range="{{unitOptions}}" value="{{unitIndex}}" bindchange="unitChange"><view class="input">{{unitOptions[unitIndex]}}</view></picker><button class="primary" bindtap="match">匹配共享货源示例</button><block wx:if="{{matchResult}}"><view class="note">需求{{matchResult.kg}}kg / 匹配{{matchResult.rows.length}}批。示例基准日2026-08-29，不是今天库存。</view><view wx:for="{{matchResult.rows}}" wx:key="id" class="value-proof"><text>{{item.id}} / {{item.product}}</text><view class="muted small">{{item.grade}} · {{item.kg}}kg · 示例时效{{item.date}}</view><text class="pill">{{item.quality}}</text></view><textarea class="textarea" data-field="description" value="{{description}}" bindinput="edit" placeholder="用途、需要时间与质量要求（测试）"/><button class="secondary" bindtap="saveDemand">保存分级需求草稿</button></block></view>
<view wx:if="{{view === 'collaboration' || view === 'feedback'}}" class="surface"><text class="heading">{{view === 'feedback' ? '反馈回到生产与服务' : '缺项跟进与队伍协同'}}</text><textarea class="textarea" data-field="description" value="{{description}}" bindinput="edit" maxlength="600" placeholder="关联批次/工单、问题依据与跟进要求（仅测试）"/><button class="primary" bindtap="saveNote">保存本机{{view === 'feedback' ? '反馈' : '跟进'}}草稿</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="help">联系帮助中心</button><view class="small muted gap">不自动派单、验收、退款或公开评分；跟进记录不等于问题已解决。</view></view>
<view class="surface" wx:if="{{drafts.length}}"><text class="heading">当前账号及身份的草稿</text><view wx:for="{{drafts}}" wx:key="id" class="value-proof"><text class="pill">{{item.status}}</text><view class="value-copy">{{item.text}}</view><text class="small muted">{{item.at}}</text></view></view>
</block><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="success">{{notice}}</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="back">返回工作台</button><view class="demo-foot">农户平台服务费0 · 办卡/补卡100元/张 · 不保证溢价或收益</view></view>
